
# SciSpace - Your AI Research Assistant

https://scispace.com

## Empowering Academic Discovery and Writing

SciSpace is an AI-powered platform designed to accelerate research workflows. It assists researchers, students, and professionals with literature review, paper reading, academic writing, citation generation, and more. From parsing complex PDFs to generating literature summaries and references, SciSpace acts as a copilot across every step of the research journey.

### Core Capabilities & Tools

[Chat with PDF](https://scispace.com/chat-pdf): Upload any PDF and ask questions about it. Get AI-generated, citation-linked answers with references to specific paragraphs and sections.

[Literature Review Search] (https://scispace.com/search): Run an AI-powered literature search over 280M+ papers. Extract summaries and gaps to assist in systematic reviews.

[AI Writer] (https://scispace.com/ai-writer): Generate academic content with context-aware suggestions. Ideal for structuring papers, abstracts, or rewriting sections.

[Citation Generator] (https://scispace.com/citation-generator): Automatically format citations in APA, MLA, Chicago, and 2300+ styles. Paste a DOI or title and get instant references.

[Paraphraser] (https://scispace.com/paraphraser): Rewrite text to improve clarity, tone, and originality while retaining core meaning. Great for academic integrity.

[AI Detector] (https://scispace.com/ai-detector): Analyse if a piece of text was AI-generated or human-written. Supports plagiarism detection workflows.

[Extract Data from PDFs] (https://scispace.com/extract-data): Upload multiple PDFs and extract findings, tables, and data points across them for quick synthesis.

[Find Topics] (https://scispace.com/concepts): Visual tool to discover trending research topics and linked areas based on semantic clustering of papers.

[PDF to Video] (https://scispace.com/pdf-to-video): Convert research papers into engaging videos to summarise and share findings visually.

[Resources Hub] (https://scispace.com/resources): Articles, citation style guides, research writing tips, and best practices for using AI in academia.

[Templates] (https://scispace.com/templates): Step-by-step academic writing templates for literature reviews, proposals, thesis, essays, etc.


